WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.645
An eclipse, seen from the Moon.

00:02.294 --> 00:04.142
It carried ten NASA instruments.

00:04.475 --> 00:11.690
On 14 March 2025 it watched the Earth pass in front of the Sun, a total eclipse seen from the Moon.

00:12.277 --> 00:19.738
Two days later it filmed the sunset, looking for a glow over the horizon that Gene Cernan saw on Apollo 17.
